        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#Prediction_Window</IRI>
        <Literal>Prediction Window</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#REN_Asset</IRI>
        <Literal>Assets in the RENergetic assets may be everything from energy islands, buildings, devices to the users of the system. They may be connected using asset connections. The asset type, which is its own table in the database, is implicitely modelled via the different classes. Similarly, the asset connection is handled via relations.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#REN_Asset</IRI>
        <Literal>Asset</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
