        <IRI>#Unknown</IRI>
        <Literal>Unknown Domain</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#User_Demand_Definition</IRI>
        <Literal>Defines the demand by choosing an action, an action type and a message. In the  User_Demand_Schedule, the demand defined here is linked to a user and a time when the demand is active.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#User_Demand_Definition</IRI>
        <Literal>User Demand Definition</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#User_Demand_Schedule</IRI>
        <Literal>Defines the time when the demand as defined in a user demand schedule is valid. The timestamps determine from when on up to which point the demand is valid. The schedule also references the applicable asset and the demand definition.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>#User_Demand_Schedule</IRI>
        <Literal>User Demand Schedule</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
